WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.042 --> 00:00:02.294
♪ Dramatic music ♪

00:00:03.253 --> 00:00:05.547
They say we're running out of
resources.

00:00:05.631 --> 00:00:06.757
♪

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:08.675
That we won't be able to fix
things.

00:00:08.759 --> 00:00:12.262
♪

00:00:12.721 --> 00:00:14.932
Well, they don't know that we are
the resources.

00:00:15.390 --> 00:00:19.019
♪ Inspirational music ♪

00:00:19.102 --> 00:00:20.896
So when the universe calls...

00:00:20.979 --> 00:00:23.524
♪

00:00:23.607 --> 00:00:25.567
Helios answers.

00:00:25.651 --> 00:00:28.695
♪

00:00:29.488 --> 00:00:31.073
We build with other nations.

00:00:31.156 --> 00:00:33.283
♪

00:00:33.367 --> 00:00:35.202
We find new hope.

00:00:35.285 --> 00:00:36.203
♪

00:00:36.286 --> 00:00:38.288
Our future depends on us.

00:00:39.373 --> 00:00:40.707
Their future depends on us.

00:00:40.791 --> 00:00:42.793
♪

00:00:43.085 --> 00:00:45.921
We all want to find our place
in this universe.

00:00:46.004 --> 00:00:48.507
♪

00:00:48.590 --> 00:00:50.467
We all want to leave a legacy.

00:00:50.551 --> 00:00:51.426
♪

00:00:51.510 --> 00:00:53.387
Your destiny awaits.

00:00:54.054 --> 00:00:56.014
Come join us on Mars.

